WEBVTT

00:00:12.813 --> 00:00:14.713
Open the door!
Open it!

00:00:17.051 --> 00:00:18.109
Laura!

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:20.051
Laura!

00:00:20.821 --> 00:00:22.789
Doctor, stop it!
Please!

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:25.420
What are you doing?
Let me go!

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:32.359
Please!
Please, open the door!

00:00:50.684 --> 00:00:52.914
Dammit!
What's going on in there?!

00:00:53.988 --> 00:00:55.922
The door's too
damaged to open.

00:00:56.023 --> 00:00:58.549
The only way in there is
to cut it off its hinges.

00:00:58.659 --> 00:01:01.356
We have no choice...
Call the Captain!

00:01:01.695 --> 00:01:03.720
We have to get
that door open!

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:21.674
We'll burn in from the
air duct in the ceiling.

00:01:21.782 --> 00:01:23.750
Go to it!

00:01:24.051 --> 00:01:29.046
Sakomizu, I'll expect an
explanation when this is over.

00:02:02.022 --> 00:02:03.421
What's happening?!

00:02:03.891 --> 00:02:06.622
Give me a status report!
Do you read?!

00:02:58.979 --> 00:03:02.176
What is this?
Is it human?

00:03:02.283 --> 00:03:05.378
Have we been carrying
this monster all along?

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:09.212
Is this what killed my men?!

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:12.853
Everything's been nuts
since you people got here!

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:14.724
I want the truth!

00:03:14.828 --> 00:03:16.387
What are you going to do?

00:03:16.497 --> 00:03:19.728
Until I get a straight answer,
you're all confined to quarters!

00:03:37.251 --> 00:03:39.185
Here you are.

00:03:40.287 --> 00:03:42.517
I've finally
found you, Doctor.

00:03:46.193 --> 00:03:50.187
The Captain decided
to let me go.

00:03:52.199 --> 00:03:55.362
Have you come to pray?

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:59.505
Only if God will
answer my question.

00:03:59.907 --> 00:04:01.375
Question...?

00:04:03.043 --> 00:04:04.704
About that girl.

00:04:05.012 --> 00:04:05.945
Don't be ridiculous!

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:10.175
I won't let you make Laura
remember what happened in there!

00:04:10.317 --> 00:04:11.409
Listen to me.

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:16.122
My research has been
thrown back to square one.

00:04:17.191 --> 00:04:21.128
The Vajranoid, the ultimate pilot,
was somehow made to run amuck...

00:04:21.228 --> 00:04:23.890
...and self-destructed
as a result.

00:04:25.299 --> 00:04:27.063
She had nothing
to do with that!

00:04:28.102 --> 00:04:31.003
We'll have to leave soon...

00:04:31.105 --> 00:04:33.540
...but there's still one
thing I don't understand.

00:04:34.441 --> 00:04:37.172
Our man in the
room was killed...

00:04:37.611 --> 00:04:39.545
...as were the two engineers
in the duct overhead.

00:04:39.647 --> 00:04:41.411
So why is that girl
still alive?

00:04:42.316 --> 00:04:45.377
Tell me! What happened in there?!
You know, don't you'?

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:51.556
Did someone save you'?
Please, tell me!

00:04:51.925 --> 00:04:53.222
What are you doing?!

00:04:53.694 --> 00:04:56.186
Stop it! Don't you
know where you are?!

00:04:57.231 --> 00:04:58.198
Let me go!

00:04:58.299 --> 00:05:02.896
Father, I don't want him near
Laura! Get him out of here!

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:06.601
Her body's hiding
something special!

00:05:07.041 --> 00:05:09.373
I have a right to
know what it is!

00:05:11.312 --> 00:05:13.280
Bastard...
You can go to hell!

00:05:15.182 --> 00:05:17.913
Laura, it's alright.

00:05:18.018 --> 00:05:20.612
I'll take care of you,
no matter what.

00:05:20.721 --> 00:05:22.883
Don't worry about
a thing, okay?

00:05:27.761 --> 00:05:28.728
Rumors?

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:33.558
All these "accidents"
have the men spooked, sir.

00:05:35.669 --> 00:05:38.297
Should we contact
the admiral?

00:05:38.405 --> 00:05:41.170
Try and change the mission?
Impossible.

00:05:41.742 --> 00:05:44.302
But under the circumstances--

00:05:44.411 --> 00:05:46.072
Think a moment.

00:05:46.413 --> 00:05:49.872
This disarmament movement has
moved a lot of countries to...

00:05:49.983 --> 00:05:51.781
...close U.S. bases
all over the world.

00:05:51.885 --> 00:05:56.914
This carrier was built to
make up for losing them.

00:05:57.558 --> 00:06:01.392
Being late could blow
this entire operation.

00:06:02.229 --> 00:06:04.357
No, we have to
keep to the schedule!

00:06:56.283 --> 00:06:57.375
A Vajra aura...

00:07:02.423 --> 00:07:07.122
S-A-V-E M-E...

00:07:09.863 --> 00:07:14.528
The Vajranoid's cellular structure
was modified by its Vajra energy.

00:07:15.569 --> 00:07:19.506
And so its cells couldn't survive
outside of a mind shadow field.

00:07:20.607 --> 00:07:25.545
I thought the suit's destruction
would be the end of it.

00:07:27.815 --> 00:07:29.715
But there's no mistake!

00:07:29.817 --> 00:07:32.809
There's a high-level
mind shadow in there.

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:35.946
But, this arm...?!

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:45.298
The Vajranoid's still alive?!

00:07:45.966 --> 00:07:47.161
Exactly.

00:07:47.267 --> 00:07:49.565
I don't believe it.
It's impossible!

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:54.801
The Vajranoid can't maintain its
body integrity without the suit!

00:07:55.509 --> 00:07:58.206
True... Until now.

00:07:58.912 --> 00:07:59.902
"Until now"...?

00:08:00.013 --> 00:08:02.983
Yes, and I've
gotten the proof.

00:08:03.083 --> 00:08:06.280
Or rather, you could say
the proof came to me.

00:08:06.553 --> 00:08:09.579
What are you talking about?
Can you be a little clearer?

00:08:09.923 --> 00:08:15.657
The Vajranoid told me there
was an enemy on this ship.

00:08:15.762 --> 00:08:19.289
That's what it must
have been fighting.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:21.099
You're saying...!

00:08:21.201 --> 00:08:24.000
This "enemy"...
What is it?

00:08:24.171 --> 00:08:27.300
A life form which
possesses Vajra energy!

00:08:27.407 --> 00:08:29.466
Not like our Vajranoid...

00:08:29.576 --> 00:08:32.807
but one that can spontaneously
generate its own mind shadow.

00:08:32.913 --> 00:08:35.780
The Vajranoid attempted
to fuse with it...

00:08:35.883 --> 00:08:38.716
...just as it did with
the fighter in the test.

00:08:38.819 --> 00:08:42.722
And so it survived inside part of its
opponent when its body was destroyed.

00:08:42.823 --> 00:08:45.451
-- You said you had proof?
-- Of course.

00:08:45.559 --> 00:08:46.549
Then let us see it!

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:49.527
You'll see it soon enough,
if I can depend on you.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.291
What do you mean?

00:08:51.398 --> 00:08:55.801
Our test was a complete failure.
Several people have died.

00:08:55.903 --> 00:08:59.771
What happens when we go
back with such a failure?

00:09:00.774 --> 00:09:04.233
Without a doubt,
they'll cancel this project...

00:09:04.344 --> 00:09:06.335
...we've given ten
years of our lives.

00:09:06.446 --> 00:09:07.811
Can you live with that?

00:09:08.248 --> 00:09:09.545
Of course not!

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:13.314
Are you saying we
have another option?

00:09:13.420 --> 00:09:18.324
Our only remaining course is to
throw the Vajranoid into battle...

00:09:18.425 --> 00:09:21.087
...and let the world
see its power.

00:09:21.194 --> 00:09:24.164
With your cooperation,
we can do it!

00:09:24.698 --> 00:09:26.325
Well, gentlemen?

00:09:27.234 --> 00:09:28.963
Tell us what
we have to do.

00:09:29.069 --> 00:09:31.936
Right, we don't
have much time!

00:09:32.039 --> 00:09:34.838
Let's do it, Chief!
It's all we have left.

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:42.007
Once again, we'll have
our almighty Vajranoid.

00:09:42.115 --> 00:09:43.583
And this will give it to us.

00:09:59.733 --> 00:10:00.962
Storm's brewing...

00:10:39.806 --> 00:10:40.637
Father...

00:10:40.874 --> 00:10:42.308
Yes, my son?

00:10:42.409 --> 00:10:44.878
I believe in God now.

00:10:46.446 --> 00:10:49.347
He finally
answered my question.

00:10:49.816 --> 00:10:52.342
Before you go,
stop by the ship's chapel.

00:10:52.452 --> 00:10:56.355
God may yet
forgive your sins.

00:12:46.466 --> 00:12:47.365
It's begun!

00:12:53.173 --> 00:12:54.538
What's going on?

00:12:55.809 --> 00:12:59.268
Something's making the
ship's controls go nuts!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.905
And it's not the storm?

00:13:02.015 --> 00:13:04.814
I doubt it, sir.

00:13:04.918 --> 00:13:08.821
All electrical systems are out,
even the inboard comm system.

00:13:08.922 --> 00:13:10.720
We're completely isolated.

00:13:11.424 --> 00:13:15.190
Use the searchlight to signal
our condition to the other ships.

00:13:15.295 --> 00:13:18.663
And get status reports
from all sections!

00:13:19.266 --> 00:13:25.899
Oh Lord, please protect
the men aboard this vessel.

00:13:34.714 --> 00:13:36.682
What the devil...?!

00:13:39.186 --> 00:13:40.813
Abomination!

00:13:42.589 --> 00:13:44.284
Get back!
Get back or we'll shoot!

00:13:46.193 --> 00:13:48.161
Cap...tain...

00:14:24.431 --> 00:14:25.523
Somebody...

00:14:35.375 --> 00:14:38.777
Chief... Help me...

00:15:29.729 --> 00:15:30.855
Mama!

00:15:31.798 --> 00:15:32.526
Laura!

00:16:51.578 --> 00:16:52.704
A monster!

00:16:52.812 --> 00:16:55.338
So, you've managed to survive.

00:16:56.716 --> 00:17:00.812
You are to be part of
a grand destiny, Doctor.

00:17:01.621 --> 00:17:03.919
You--
You're alive?!

00:17:04.024 --> 00:17:06.789
Of course.
I am beyond death's reach.

00:17:07.093 --> 00:17:11.587
My body is evolving
as we speak.

00:17:11.698 --> 00:17:15.362
I can't describe how
extraordinary it feels.

00:17:15.468 --> 00:17:17.232
That monster on board...?!

00:17:17.337 --> 00:17:21.570
Our research has
reached its ideal form.

00:17:21.674 --> 00:17:24.974
The Alexandria is no
longer merely a weapon...

00:17:25.078 --> 00:17:28.173
...but is being reborn as
a super life form.

00:17:28.448 --> 00:17:33.181
The crew's bodies have
fused with the Vajranoid...

00:17:33.286 --> 00:17:36.017
...but they still retain
their consciousness.

00:17:36.122 --> 00:17:39.057
So I suppose you could
say they still live.

00:17:39.159 --> 00:17:43.687
The creature is full of their
desire to destroy their enemy.

00:17:43.797 --> 00:17:47.062
When we enter
the Gulf of Karain...

00:17:47.167 --> 00:17:51.263
...it will smash
the shoreline forces.

00:17:51.571 --> 00:17:55.007
We will see them
utterly destroyed!

00:17:57.811 --> 00:17:59.802
Well now...

00:17:59.913 --> 00:18:01.711
Enough of this talk.

00:18:04.684 --> 00:18:05.480
Now, come...

00:18:07.187 --> 00:18:09.121
To your glorious new life!

00:18:14.761 --> 00:18:17.492
You won't fool me!
You're a monster, too!

00:18:17.831 --> 00:18:21.699
I won't let you lay
one finger on my Laura.

00:18:53.166 --> 00:18:57.467
It's dead...
We killed it!

00:18:59.873 --> 00:19:03.707
Laura and I killed it!

00:19:08.248 --> 00:19:12.310
Laura! We have to kill
the monster on this ship!

00:19:12.418 --> 00:19:14.853
Kill it for all
the men it's killed!

00:19:24.297 --> 00:19:25.162
Laura...

00:19:25.265 --> 00:19:28.326
All dead...

00:19:28.434 --> 00:19:30.402
Laura, you're calling to me.

00:19:31.838 --> 00:19:36.332
All dead...
But...l will not die...

00:19:38.244 --> 00:19:41.214
And you, Myra...
You will not die...

00:20:07.106 --> 00:20:08.574
Mama!

00:20:10.043 --> 00:20:12.068
Laura...

00:21:15.975 --> 00:21:20.242
This is helicopter KK-9.
Have recovered one American woman.

00:21:22.015 --> 00:21:24.313
No response.
What's going on?

00:21:25.551 --> 00:21:27.246
What the hell?!

00:21:36.429 --> 00:21:39.626
What's happened?
Our country...!

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:42.068
-- What's that?!
-- It's Laura!

00:21:42.535 --> 00:21:46.438
Laura's come back!
She's an angel now!

00:21:50.343 --> 00:21:52.573
Laura, Mama's here!

00:21:53.012 --> 00:21:55.674
Come back!
Take me with you!

00:21:55.782 --> 00:21:57.773
-- Stop it!
-- Laura, please!

00:21:57.884 --> 00:21:59.579
Take me! Take me!

00:21:59.686 --> 00:22:02.519
Take me away from this hell!

00:22:02.622 --> 00:22:04.056
LAURA!!!

00:22:18.438 --> 00:22:24.343
I want you, and love you
Fairy Dreamin'.

00:22:24.444 --> 00:22:29.075
I lie in bed tonight,
counting the stars above.

00:22:30.450 --> 00:22:35.354
And once again,
I call out to you.

00:22:35.988 --> 00:22:41.950
The bustling town,
sparkling outside.

00:22:42.061 --> 00:22:47.625
Shining like a dreamy rainbow,

00:22:47.734 --> 00:22:50.362
little my dear Fairy.

00:22:51.871 --> 00:22:57.310
It was a little lie,
an important one.

00:22:57.410 --> 00:23:00.311
One that I couldn't say.

00:23:00.413 --> 00:23:07.285
The dream I had, on this night,
about you, my darling,

00:23:07.387 --> 00:23:15.387
Now I know, I'll never have
that dream again.

00:23:16.429 --> 00:23:24.429
I don't have the strength
to stop the hands of time.

00:23:25.705 --> 00:23:33.705
So don't forget my dear,
I love you, Fairy Dreamin'.

00:24:06.879 --> 00:24:10.645
Genocyber: Cyber Monster from
the Imaginary World. Next stage:

00:24:10.750 --> 00:24:12.878
The final world war is fought.

00:24:12.985 --> 00:24:16.580
A make-or-break battle between
Genocyber and the Kuryu Group.

00:24:16.689 --> 00:24:18.589
In the peaceful city of
Ark de Grande...

00:24:18.691 --> 00:24:21.661
...people have traded freedom
for shelter from the aftermath.

00:24:21.761 --> 00:24:25.459
But the city holds
an unknown secret...

00:24:25.565 --> 00:24:28.626
...and a soulful vision
reveals an undying legend.

00:24:28.734 --> 00:24:32.432
Super Cult Animation
"Genocyber, Part 4:"

00:24:32.538 --> 00:24:35.030
"The Legend of Ark de Grande"
Act One

00:24:35.141 --> 00:24:37.667
The seal has now been broken...
